diff --git a/docs/Changelog.md b/docs/Changelog.md
index 09e46fb68..1887c0996 100644
--- a/docs/Changelog.md
+++ b/docs/Changelog.md
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 Want to stay in the loop on major new features? Join our mailing list by
 sending a mail to <afl-users+subscribe@googlegroups.com>.
 
-### Version ++3.13a (development)
+### Version ++3.13c (release)
   - Note: plot_data switched to relative time from unix time in 3.10
   - frida_mode - new mode that uses frida to fuzz binary-only targets,
     it currently supports persistent mode and cmplog.

commit f9ca2cf98938ae382d0affc47dbbc78d7291708b
Author: vanhauser-thc <vh@thc.org>
Date:   Tue Jun 1 12:15:14 2021 +0200

    v3.13c release

diff --git a/docs/Changelog.md b/docs/Changelog.md
index 09e46fb68..1887c0996 100644
--- a/docs/Changelog.md
+++ b/docs/Changelog.md
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 Want to stay in the loop on major new features? Join our mailing list by
 sending a mail to <afl-users+subscribe@googlegroups.com>.
 
-### Version ++3.13a (development)
+### Version ++3.13c (release)
   - Note: plot_data switched to relative time from unix time in 3.10
   - frida_mode - new mode that uses frida to fuzz binary-only targets,
     it currently supports persistent mode and cmplog.

