+
+  - Made cosmetic improvements to docs and to the CPU load indicator.
+
+  - Fixed a glitch with crash removal (README.txt left behind, d'oh).
+
+### Version 0.60b:
+
+  - Fixed problems with jump tables generated by exotic versions of GCC. This
